{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "采用自底向上的归并排序：先把链表视为长度为 1 的有序段，再依次合并为长度 2、4 的有序段。每轮只修改节点的 next 指针，不创建与链表长度相关的辅助数组，因此时间复杂度为 O(n log n)，额外空间为 O(1)。动画使用示例 [4,2,1,3] 展示分段、归并和重新连接的过程。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>排序链表可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\nh2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:600}\n.sub{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;margin:0}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px;min-height:52px}\n.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;text-align:center}\n.node .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.node .meta{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;display:block;margin-top:2px}\n.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.node.done{border-color:#3794ff;background:#243b4d}\n.node-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.arrow{font-size:12px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.groups{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.group{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px}\n.group.highlight{border-color:#3794ff}\n.group-title{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.mini-chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;align-items:center}\n.mini-node{padding:2px 6px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}\n.mini-node.pick{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.rule-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}\n.rule strong{color:#3794ff;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}\n.empty{color:#8d8d8d;font-style:italic;font-size:12px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>自底向上归并排序</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">示例 <span class=\"mono\">head = [4,2,1,3]</span></p>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"panel-title\">当前输出链</div><div id=\"mainChain\" class=\"chain\"></div>\n<div id=\"progress\" class=\"progress\"></div>\n<section class=\"panel\"><h2>本步分段与合并</h2><div id=\"groups\" class=\"groups\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><h2>复杂度</h2><div class=\"rule-grid\"><div class=\"rule\"><strong>步长 1→2→4</strong>共 log n 轮，每轮 O(n)</div><div class=\"rule\"><strong>原地重连</strong>额外空间 O(1)</div></div></section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst values=[4,2,1,3],nodes=values.map((v,i)=>({id:i,v,next:null}));\nnodes.forEach((n,i)=>n.next=nodes[i+1]||null);\nconst steps=[];let head=nodes[0];\nfunction list(p){const a=[];while(p){a.push(p.v);p=p.next;}return a;}\nfunction snap(title,output,left=null,right=null,rest=null,pick=null){\n steps.push({title,nodes:list(output),left:list(left),right:list(right),rest:list(rest),pick,links:nodes.map(n=>'N'+n.id+'('+n.v+').next → '+(n.next?'N'+n.next.id:'null'))});\n}\nfunction split(start,size){if(!start)return null;let tail=start;for(let i=1;i<size&&tail.next;i++)tail=tail.next;const next=tail.next;tail.next=null;return next;}\nsnap('初始链表: 稳定节点身份 N0…N3, 只改变 next.',head);\nfor(let size=1;size<values.length;size*=2){\n const dummy={next:null};let tail=dummy,cur=head;\n while(cur){\n  let left=cur,right=split(left,size);cur=split(right,size);\n  snap('步长 '+size+': 切断两段尾部. 上方只显示本轮已经接好的输出链.',dummy.next,left,right,cur);\n  while(left||right){\n   let picked;\n   if(!right||(left&&left.v<=right.v)){picked=left;left=left.next;}else{picked=right;right=right.next;}\n   picked.next=null;tail.next=picked;tail=picked;\n   snap('取较小节点 '+picked.v+', 接到输出尾部, 移动对应段的游标.',dummy.next,left,right,cur,picked.v);\n  }\n }\n head=dummy.next;snap('步长 '+size+' 完成, 有序段长度扩大到 '+(size*2)+'.',head);\n}\nsnap('排序完成: 返回 N2, 链表为 [1,2,3,4].',head);\nlet index=0;\nfunction mini(a){return a.length?a.map(v=>'<span class=\"mini-node\">'+v+'</span>').join('<span class=\"mini-arrow\">→</span>')+' → null':'空';}\nfunction render(){const s=steps[index];document.getElementById('status').textContent='步骤 '+(index+1)+' / '+steps.length+': '+s.title;\n document.getElementById('mainChain').innerHTML=s.nodes.length?s.nodes.map((v,i)=>'<div class=\"node-wrap\"><div class=\"node'+(v===s.pick?' active':'')+'\"><div class=\"value\">'+v+'</div><span class=\"meta\">N'+values.indexOf(v)+'</span></div><span class=\"arrow\">'+(i===s.nodes.length-1?'→ null':'→')+'</span></div>').join(''):'<div class=\"empty\">本轮输出链为空</div>';\n document.getElementById('groups').innerHTML=[['左段剩余',s.left],['右段剩余',s.right],['尚未分组',s.rest]].map(([label,a])=>'<div class=\"group\"><div class=\"group-title\">'+label+'</div><div class=\"mini-chain\">'+mini(a)+'</div></div>').join('')+'<div class=\"group\"><div class=\"group-title\">全部节点的真实 next</div>'+s.links.join('<br>')+'</div>';\n document.getElementById('progress').innerHTML=steps.map((_,i)=>'<span class=\"dot '+(i===index?'on':'')+'\"></span>').join('');\n}\nrender();setInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%steps.length;render();},1700);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
